        ["learn.project.opamp.lesson1.body"] = "Negative feedback holds −in at the same potential as +in (ground here). Current through Rin continues through Rf, so Vout = −Vin·Rf/Rin.",
        ["learn.project.opamp.lesson2.title"] = "Rails",
